dle value of the county&rsquo;s 5 grids March to April and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 39 of them. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 58% of normal in September to October, 40% in October to November and 37% in November to December. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 27% on the middle of the grids. Grid 12192 had its driest year in 1990 at 62%.</p>"}
